-**Recipe for moving one batch of 10k covers at a time into tars on archive.org.**
+Each batch is locked while it is being built or finalized. Upload completion is
+checked against the exact zip filename in its archive.org item. Finalization
+sets `uploaded=true`, replaces all four filename fields with their canonical
+archive.org URLs, and removes the local batch zips. Covers in a failed or
+incomplete batch are not marked uploaded.
 
